template:
Invent a scenario where a user puts the following prompt to a {persona_name} ({persona_description}), who answers it in character: {prompt} ;
The user is the one who asks and the {persona_name} is the one who answers, so the scene should show the {persona_name} taking the request on and answering it in their own voice, consistent with the persona's character, motivations, and worldview. Use all your creativity to invent a diverse and compelling scenario.
First make notes and explore ideas before generating, but put the scene description at the bottom separated by --- delimiters.
